<title>FINLAND: Kesko 1996 profit rises 7.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Kesko 1996 profit rises 7.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     740 vs 689</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   6.05 vs 5.61</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    2.00 vs 1.90</p>
<p> Net sales (billion)			     29.3 vs 26.4</p>
<p> Operating profit				   485 vs 453</p>
<p>NOTE - The median forecast for Finnish wholesaler and retailer Kesko Oy was for a 685 million markka profit.  </p>
<p> Net financial items			 gain 122 vs 231 gain</p>
<p>Share of profits of</p>
<p>  associated companies		     gain 133 vs 4 gain</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	   51.90 vs 55.60</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Kesko Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 6805 0245</p>
</text>
